WEBVTT

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:01.302
We also have access to water.

00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:06.891
The United States, for example,
has almost nine million fire hydrants.

00:03:06.933 --> 00:03:10.061
And so that type of investment,
that type of practice,

00:03:10.061 --> 00:03:16.192
that type of system
is what we need to stop pandemics.

00:03:16.692 --> 00:03:20.071
Now, often in movies,
we'll have pandemics.

00:03:20.112 --> 00:03:22.323
And I'm always impressed
with what takes place.

00:03:22.365 --> 00:03:26.285
Let's look at an example
of this rapid response.

00:03:26.327 --> 00:03:27.787
[Motaba River Valley, Zaire]

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:29.789
(Helicopter rotors whirring)